---

## 5-email compression
For a leaner flow, merge:
- **E1 Welcome & Incentive** (immediate)
- **E2 Story + Proof** (merge founder story + 2 reviews) — +2 days
- **E3 Product Education / Bestsellers** — +4 days
- **E4 Offer Reminder + Countdown** (bump) — +6 days · opened & non-buyer
- **E5 Final Urgency** — +8 days · opened & non-buyer

Drops the standalone Why-Us email and one discount bump; keeps welcome → trust →
product → urgency → last-chance.

## Build order per client
1. Confirm: # of emails (5/7), discount-led vs value-led, cadence, offer(s).
2. Swap library tokens (font + colors); host waves/icons/images.
3. Build each email from its component list; save Header/Trust Badges/Footer as
   Universal Content. 4. Set flow timing + non-buyer exit + opened-filter on bump emails.
5. Coupons verbatim; compliant footer; preheader ≠ subject.